    "description": "Greetings Capacitor Ionic Community, today I'll be helping you setup Capacitor-updater into your app. So that you can do seamless releases.",
    "author": "Martin Donadieu",
    "author_image_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4084527?v=4",
